\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-0\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡0 \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}\\cdot 1-0 \\\\  & =\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. Since $F$ is conservative and ${C}_{2}$ has the same initial and terminal points as ${C}_{1},$ we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{{C}_{2}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r={\\int }_{{C}_{1}}F\\cdot \\text{d}r=\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\"" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337789 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337790 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337791 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337792 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1000 #edb/ref 17592186337793 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1041 "selection" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1104 #edb/ref 17592186337789 13194139535212 true] [17592186337788 1110 #uuid "2be32b04-ab31-53c5-934e-876fcc3f93f9" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337789 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337789 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535212 true] [17592186337789 1111 #uuid "f5bed039-2ea9-5c61-9ed8-a6184811ece3" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337790 1034 "I only" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337790 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535212 true] [17592186337790 1111 #uuid "89ae9dc7-503a-578a-adba-372cb9f081d5" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337791 1034 "III only" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337791 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535212 true] [17592186337791 1111 #uuid "09029aa3-c509-5bdc-a7e0-d2b9dd46cc25" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337792 1034 "I and II only" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337792 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535212 true] [17592186337792 1111 #uuid "130efee0-bb8a-5e2a-bae5-a926f65e674d" 13194139535212 true] [17592186337793 1034 "II only" 13194139535212 true] [175